### 1. Verifica connessione
GET https://elasticsearch-jeeg-77-dev.apps.rm1.0a51.p1.openshiftapps.com/

### 2. Creazione indice BOOKS con mapping (da fare una volta sola)
PUT https://elasticsearch-jeeg-77-dev.apps.rm1.0a51.p1.openshiftapps.com/books
Content-Type: application/json

< ./mapping.json

### 3. Inserimento libri tramite Bulk API (da fare una volta sola)
POST https://elasticsearch-jeeg-77-dev.apps.rm1.0a51.p1.openshiftapps.com/_bulk
Content-Type: application/x-ndjson

< ./data.json

### 4. Verifica indice
GET https://elasticsearch-jeeg-77-dev.apps.rm1.0a51.p1.openshiftapps.com/_cat/indices?v

### 5. Conteggio libri
GET https://elasticsearch-jeeg-77-dev.apps.rm1.0a51.p1.openshiftapps.com/books/_count

### 6. Visualizzazione di tutti i libri
GET https://elasticsearch-jeeg-77-dev.apps.rm1.0a51.p1.openshiftapps.com/books/_search?pretty

### 7. Ricerca per titolo
POST https://elasticsearch-jeeg-77-dev.apps.rm1.0a51.p1.openshiftapps.com/books/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match": {
      "title": "Delitto"
    }
  }
}

### 8. Ricerca per autore
POST https://elasticsearch-jeeg-77-dev.apps.rm1.0a51.p1.openshiftapps.com/books/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "term": {
      "author": "Italo Svevo"
    }
  }
}

### 9. Ricerca per intervallo di anni
POST https://elasticsearch-jeeg-77-dev.apps.rm1.0a51.p1.openshiftapps.com/books/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "range": {
      "year": {
        "gte": 1900,
        "lte": 1950
      }
    }
  }
}

### 10. Aggregazione per autore
POST https://elasticsearch-jeeg-77-dev.apps.rm1.0a51.p1.openshiftapps.com/books/_search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "size": 0,
  "aggs": {
    "autori": {
      "terms": {
        "field": "author"
      }
    }
  }
}